    "original_requirement": "实现一个温度阈值设置与报警系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、电位器 A0、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。电位器用于设置温度报警阈值，TM1637 显示当前温度与阈值；当温度超过阈值时 LED 常亮且蜂鸣器周期报警。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个温度阈值设置与报警系统，使用 DHT11（D7）、电位器 A0、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。电位器用于设置温度报警阈值，TM1637 显示当前温度与阈值；当温度超过阈值时 LED 常亮且蜂鸣器周期报警。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v1\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"dht\", \"pin\": \"D7\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": null}",
